function recipientGuide(){modal(T('申请帮助，很简单','Getting help is simple'),`<div class="stack">${[T('1. 选择陪诊、采购、数码协助或陪伴交流。','1. Choose clinic accompaniment, shopping, digital help or companionship.'),T('2. 填写需求、时间和沟通语言，再确认发布。','2. Enter your needs, preferred time and language, then confirm.'),T('3. 在「我的服务」查看回应并确认预约。','3. Review responses and confirm a booking in My services.'),T('4. 见面时提供签到码，服务结束后确认并评价。','4. Share the check-in code when you meet, then confirm and review the service.')].map(t=>`<p>${t}</p>`).join('')}</div><div class="notice">${T('当前为演示，申请仅保存在此浏览器。','This demo saves requests in this browser only.')}</div>`,btn(T('开始申请','Start a request'),'create'));}
